output_amount.description:
Target destination amount in base units. Required for `exact_output`;
must be omitted for `exact_input`. The response `to_amount` equals this
value exactly.

409.description:
Transient: the first request under this `idempotency_key` is still
being served (`idempotency_key_in_flight`). Carries `Retry-After`;
once that request lands the retry replays it.
